# Submission state. `intempt recipe submit` keeps its confirm token and receipt in
# ~/.local/state/intempt-recipe-creator/, outside any working tree. These lines catch a copy that
# lands here anyway: a receipt identifies a submission and a confirm token authorizes a send.
.submit-confirm-*.json
*.receipt.json
receipt-*.json
